Mr. Tith Chantha urges young people to follow the heroic example of the elite of December 2 to continue to defend the Cambodian nation
On that occasion, Mr. Tith Chantha mentioned some important statements that the 2 December Front is a worthy ancestor for the nation and the people. December 2nd Front Day is an important historical mirror for Cambodian society. It was December 2, January 7, January 7, and all Cambodians were resurrected and everything was as it is today.
Mr. Tith Chantha urged the people, especially the younger generation, to continue to work hard to strengthen the spirit of internal unity and to learn from the heroic example of the countless sacrifices of patriarchs, elites and patriots who have done everything for the nation. And the people in particular must remember that peace is a fundamental factor of development, and at all costs must work together to maintain and protect this peace.
He said so because recently an illegal rebel group was trying to destroy peace and stability in Cambodia. They used all means to overthrow the government, deceive the people against the government and the Cambodian People's Party, the leader of the struggle to liberate the people from the genocidal regime from the war.
"But the people have not been deceived by their scams. Instead, the people have become increasingly supportive of the government and opposed to the rebels and have joined forces with the armed forces, government officials and the people," he said. The Royal Government defends the nation, religion, the King, and protects peace, stability, and the achievements of development, and firmly defends democracy.
Tith Chantha said that overthrowing the government in the manner of the rebels was not an exercise in democracy, but would bring disaster again to this miserable Cambodian nation.
He added that the historical truth is true because that is why the Cambodian people do not support such a genocidal movement, while the international community does not support such a dirty act.
Citizens, especially students, young people, the new generation, must clearly understand that history is real, written down the truth. Although young people can not imagine the bitter stories of the suffering of their parents and grandparents in the past, but also heard and researched to understand the suffering that has happened in Cambodia.
Only the Cambodian People's Party has fought to liberate the nation and its people from those atrocities, who are the real saviors of the nation.
He went on to urge the people of Baray and Taing Kork districts to preserve the historical heritage of peace that previous generations have sacrificed to build with the sea of blood and tears. Cambodia's cool beer to be leaked on social media before the official announcement
(Phnom Penh): Pictures of the new and stylish Cambodian beer can be leaked before the due date by dozens of channels through the photos posted on the Facebook page of the staff of the Cambodian Brewery Company.
The leak comes after the Cambodian Brewery celebrated its 10th anniversary on the morning of December 2 and unveiled a new look at the packaging of Cambodian beer cans to surprise staff with That beautiful new style.
But out of love and reluctance to show off this new look, the staff of Cambodia Brewery posted a picture of them with a new can, which in fact the Cambodian Brewery wants to surprise the public. On December 3 instead.
Even Michael Sovann, known as the event manager and public relations manager for Cambodia Brewery, could not help but show himself with a new Cambodian beer can with a smile on his face and a message on his personal Facebook page: "Excited." Too much mystery has been revealed and this is the new look of Cambodian beer! Cheers! ”
However, the official launch of the new appearance of Cambodia Beer continues to follow the same schedule, on December 3 tomorrow. Drugs harm you! Nationwide anti-drug campaign December 2: 21 cases cracked, 31 arrested
