Pailin Governor Calls on People to Take Extreme Health Precautions, Especially Young Children This Winter
(Pailin): Mr. Phan Chanthul, Governor of Pailin Province, on December 2, 2019, instructed and called on the people as well as patients who are being treated at the Provincial Referral Hospital to know how to take care of their health, especially young children. In this cold season.
The call was made on the occasion of visiting and bringing donations and funds to support people who are being treated at the Pailin Provincial Referral Hospital, which is the day to celebrate the 41st anniversary of the Solidarity Front. Development of the motherland of Cambodia on December 2, 2019.
On that occasion, Mr. Sao Sarath, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Mr. and Mrs. Member of the Provincial Council, Deputy Governor, as well as leaders of departments, units and institutions around the province accompanied by many people.
