(Phnom Penh): To help raise awareness of the importance of life insurance services and promote the proper use of the Khmer language in the field of life insurance, students of the Faculty of Khmer Literature and Linguistics are invited to participate in a writing competition. In Khmer, organized by Prudential Cambodia in collaboration with the Royal University of Phnom Penh.
