The Great Victory of January 7, 1979 ended the darkest period in Cambodian history, ushered in a new era, and the Cambodian people regained their rights, freedoms and opportunities to rebuild their homeland. All of our people clearly understand that without the birth of the Front on December 2 and the victory of January 7, we would not have anything like today, "this is the truth of history."
