To commemorate the historic day of the beginning of the survival of the motherland and the people of Cambodia to this day, Fresh News would like to remind some events related to the formation of the National Liberation Movement and the Cambodian people from the pit of death as follows:
The United Front for the National Salvation of Cambodia, now known as the United Front for the Development of the Motherland of Cambodia, was established on December 2, 1978 and issued its 11b statement in the Snuol Liberation Area, Snuol District, Kratie Province.
The Kampuchean United Front for National Salvation was formed by the great unity of the people, both inside and outside the country, including Samdech Akka Moha Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, Samdech Akka Moha Thamma Pothisal Chea Sim, Samdech Akka Moha Padei Techo Hun Sen and the patriotic hero Chea Many more as leaders. The reasons for the United Front for National Salvation are:
During the 1975-1978 genocidal regime of Pol Pot, the situation in the country plunged into a catastrophic catastrophe. At that time, Pol Pot's assassins pushed the country upside down in a way that no one could have imagined.
Under the banner of the absolute revolution, they began to purge Cambodian society, forcing the city to disappear, forcing millions of market people to leave their homes and property to live in the countryside, in the mountains, in the misery, and forcing them to do so. Work as a weight.
Cut off the sacred family ties between parents, grandparents, siblings, spouses, relatives, blood relatives and do not allow normal communication.
Dissolve the villagers who have been the source of the emotions and the home of our people since ancient times.
* Confiscation of production equipment, materials for personal use, forcing people to work like cattle, starving, touching clothes, touching faces, tearing back, causing all Cambodians to fall into poverty and slavery.
* The elderly are considered useless to society, are not supported, and are destroyed. Subsequently, they pursued a policy of killing more than 3 million people.
As the Pol Pot assassins dipped the motherland of Cambodia with blood and tears, the remnants of the massacre under the leadership of the patriotic heroes formed the Kampuchean United Front for National Salvation to overthrow the Pol Pot regime. Save the motherland and the people of Cambodia from the disaster of the genocidal regime and achieve complete victory on January 7, 1979.
1: Implement the path of national unity to overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot. Hold parliamentary elections throughout the country. Establish a new constitution aimed at guaranteeing the people's rights, equality, freedom and true democracy.
2: Build all associations that are members of the United Front for National Salvation of Cambodia to mobilize all forces in society, all walks of life, including women's youth associations, farmers' unions and intellectual associations, etc.
3. Build and strengthen the national army to protect the motherland, protect the life and property of the people, protect independence, sovereignty and territorial integrity.
Guarantee the physical rights and freedoms of all people. Have the right to live equally. Have the same obligations and interests.
5. Implement the independent economic path in each phase, rebuild the land that destroys and repair the new economy, the economy serves the interests on the basis of expanding agriculture and industry. Eliminate coercion, eradicate rice harvest, people's property, open banks, distribute banknotes, repair and expand the exchange of all goods, open domestic trade, abolish forced labor.
6: Abolish the marriage regime by force. Implement the family livelihood system, implement equal rights between men and women. Encourage women to study culture and vocational subjects to serve society, support the disabled, the families of victims. Take care of the elderly, orphans, widows. There is a right path for Cambodians living abroad and foreigners living in Cambodia.
10. Resolve all disputes with neighboring countries peacefully on the basis of respect for each other's independence, sovereignty and territorial integrity. End the border war with Vietnam caused by Pol Pot. Re-establish good relations and cooperation in the sense of villagers and fences with the countries in the Southeast Asian region, contribute to building the Southeast Asian region as a center of peace, independence, freedom, neutrality, stability and prosperity.
