(Kampong Cham): Mr. Veng Sakhon, Chairman of the National Assistance Team for Kampong Siem and Cheung Prey Districts, Kampong Cham Province and Tambor District, Tbong Khmum Province, this morning, November 30, 2019, presided over a public meeting to celebrate the anniversary. 41st (December 2, 1978 - December 2, 2019) Birthday of the United Front for the Development of the Motherland of Cambodia in the area of Wat Nokor Bachey in Ampil Leu village, Ampil commune, Kampong Siem district.
The event was also attended by Mr. and Mrs. Chairman, Deputy Chairman of the Working Group, Working Group Members, Teachers, Students, Armed Forces, Local Authorities and 2,500 people from 15 communes. Of Kampong Siem District, Kampong Cham Province.
Speaking on that occasion, Mr. Veng Sakhon brought a message from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian People's Party and Prime Minister, Samdech Kittiprit Dr. Bun Rany Hun Sen, Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin and Samdech Vibol Sena Phekdey Say Chhum, who always thought From the well-being and living problems of the people in all circumstances.
Mr. Veng Sakhon reminded that the organization of this historic event on December 2 is to commemorate the day of the founding of the patriotic forces that united as one to fight for the liberation of the motherland and the people of Cambodia to survive. Returning from the genocide of Pol Pot, I would like to express my deepest gratitude to the heroes, warriors and patriots who have made great sacrifices for social stability and development.
He continued that because of the United Front for National Salvation of Cambodia on December 2, the victory of January 7, and there is everything today. Forty-one years ago, we will never forget the dark past, full of misery, pain, tragedy, despair, family breakdown, social insecurity, food insecurity, famine, overwork for 3 years, 8 months and 20 days under genocide. Pol Pot.
Mr. Veng Sakhon emphasized that for 41 years, the nation and its people have emerged from suffering and injury in all areas, and the government has led the country to peace, stability, development and economic growth. Win-win of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
He added that the December 2 Front not only liberated the motherland and the people of Cambodia from the dark side of Pol Pot, but also the Front / CPP and the Royal Government restored, built and developed The society has changed its face continuously. In fact, in 1993, the income of the people was only 254 USD / person, but in 2019, this income increased to 1679 USD / person.
In addition, the government has strengthened the foundation for further economic development and poverty reduction to less than 10% last year, showing a strong will to implement all comprehensive and in-depth reform policies, focusing on Focusing on four priority areas: people, roads, electricity and water.
Mr. Veng Sakhon said that all these achievements are the Royal Government has been implementing diligently, striving hard, based on the principles of national unity, national unity, maintaining stability, maintaining security, social order and national development. Nation, both now and in the future.
He said that for the future, the Royal Government of Cambodia has set four main strategic goals:
First, ensure sustainable economic growth at an average annual rate of around 7% through the diversification of the new economic base to be more comprehensive and competitive. Maintain macroeconomic stability. Gross domestic product by 2020 will reach $ 29.362 million (per capita GDP may increase to $ 1,816).
Second, create more jobs, both in quantity and quality, for the people, especially for the youth.
Fourth, continue to strengthen the capacity and governance of state institutions at both the national and sub-national levels to ensure the effectiveness of public services to better serve the people, as well as to improve the business environment and favorable environment for investment.
