(Kampong Speu): A Chhun Try sugarcane harvester in Oral district crushed a man to death in a sugarcane field on the afternoon of November 29, 2019.
According to a report from Fresh News Agency, at 2:30 pm yesterday, at Phnom Penh Sugar Company's sugar plantation, Kampong Speu, Reaksmey Village, Reaksmey Samaki Commune, Oral District, a truck carrying sugarcane was crushed to death. Powered by Chhun Try Cane Harvester.
The driver, Reach, 22, drove through the cane and crushed the victim, Kong Phon, 50, to Raksmey village, Raksmey Samaki commune, Oral district, Kampong Speu province, while the victim was drunk and fell asleep in the cane.
According to the victim's wife, Im Vin, 49, her husband went to eat at home under the influence of alcohol, and she blamed him for not drinking during the day. The husband then left the house and disappeared just after 2 pm when someone told him that her husband had been crushed to death by a sugarcane harvester.
After examining the body, the authorities handed it over to the family for a traditional ceremony.
