(Phnom Penh): The market for selling cosmetics for personal use in Cambodia now has a very high market value due to the growing number of young Cambodians, while the popularity of using cosmetics for makeup to participate in various programs required. Let them use it too.
In fact, on the night of November 29, 2019, DeMasel EK Co., Ltd. was officially inaugurated at the Phnom Penh Hotel to contribute to serving the needs of quality cosmetics to customers in Cambodia.
According to Ms. Chong Thea, CEO of DeMaSell EK, the company was established in 2019, officially authorized to distribute factory direct products to many well-known brands from Korea for its products. Beautify customers and also contribute to the development of Cambodia.
She said that the decision to open this company because of Cambodia, a developing country with rapid development and potential, meanwhile, for modern ladies and gentlemen, there is also a strong demand for cosmetics. Therefore, to meet all these essential needs, DeMasel has opened its own company and offers all customers the motto "DeMasel is always at the forefront of quality and value."
Ms. Chong Thea, who brings cosmetic products for distribution in Cambodia, said that after many visits to Korea, she saw that the cosmetic products she decided to import now were real. Famous in Korea, of course, with Koreans, especially women, used to wear makeup and beauty care.
She added that cosmetics imported from Korea to circulate in the Cambodian market are mostly face wash foam, remove dust on the face, acne scars, acne and eliminate bacteria on the face, remove dark spots, wrinkles. In addition, this product has received strong support from consumers and distributors throughout Cambodia.
Starting out as a small salesperson with little capital and no small stall selling her products, Chong Thea overcame all obstacles, although at the time her sales of small products were almost non-existent, she was determined to become You are rich like this, she does not give up in doing business.
From then on, she worked hard to sell and market herself until her sales increased day by day. Seeing this growth, she also developed from a small seller to open a sales depot. In this business, Ms. Chong Thea is very focused on marketing and promoting the quality and price of her products until there is a lot of recognition and support from customers.
