(Phnom Penh): The light criminal bureau of the Criminal Police Department of the Ministry of Interior cracked down on two mobile phone seizures that had been active in Phnom Penh. Based on the confessions of the two suspects, it is said that he had acted directly and protected from behind (closed his butt) 11 times (10 times).
Speaking to Fresh News on the afternoon of November 29, 2019, Lt. Col. Kheng Meng Chheang, Director of the Bureau of Minor Offenses, confirmed that the operation to arrest the two suspects took place after the indication of the General. Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner, Lt. Gen. In Bora, Deputy Commissioner General, and Lt. Gen. Neng Chuor, Director of the Criminal Police Department.
Colonel Kheng Meng Chheang said that the suspects that his special forces cracked down on were: 17-year-old Vong Richart and 17-year-old Rin Binang. The two suspects were arrested on November 27, 2019.
According to the confession, they had acted 11 times, 10 times by grabbing bags and mobile phones on the streets in Phnom Penh from July to November 2019. Here are the locations and times they operate:
* First: During the beginning of July 2019, a phone call from a foreigner was decided at the University of Human Resources.
* Third: During the beginning of July 2019, a mobile phone was stolen from a Chinese man along Street 310 near the sewer.
* Fifth: During the end of August 2019, a mobile phone was stolen from a foreigner at the traffic light of a 42-storey building in Boeung Keng Kang district.
* 8th: During the end of October 2019, a mobile phone was stolen from an ethnic group in front of Lux Sary Club in Sangkat Boeung Reang, Khan Daun Penh
9th: During the end of October 2019, a mobile phone was stolen from a Chinese person in front of Tuol Sleng Museum, Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang 3, Khan Boeung Keng Kang
10th: During the beginning of November 2019, a mobile phone was stolen from a Chinese person in Sangkat Toul Tum Poung 1, Khan Chamkar Morn.
* 11th: During the beginning of November 2019, intended to seize the phone from a woman, but the opportunity was not good, did not act around Street 63, Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang 1, Khan Chamkar Morn.
After the interrogation and based on the confession, the specialized force of the Criminal Police Department has built a case to send the two suspects to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to proceed with the procedure.
