(Koh Kong): Golden FX Link Capital Co., Ltd. shares knowledge on trading equipment to the public of Koh Kong Province. The Koh Kong workshop was organized under the theme "What is Derivatives Trading: Investment Preparation and Relevant Awareness?"
This is the 11th time in 2019 and the 16th time since the emergence of provincial workshops in 2018. The main purpose of this participation is to share knowledge, skills, experience as well as good tips for investing to the public in all provinces of Cambodia.
Mr. Phay Thonplam Keson, Deputy Governor of Koh Kong Province, highlighted the potential of Koh Kong Province and stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia has taken into account the people in all areas, especially the development of the economy, which is reflected in Economic reforms that have helped Cambodia to grow at around 7% per year.
He added that through this workshop, participants are expected to gain additional financial and investment knowledge, especially in the derivatives market.
Mr. Sou Socheat, Director General of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia, presented the status of the derivatives market in Cambodia, as well as the position of the Securities and Exchange Commission of Cambodia in expanding the development of the derivatives market.
He encouraged investors to increase their knowledge and be ready to invest in derivatives to contribute to national economic development.
Mr. Sou Socheat continued, "The derivatives market has greatly benefited the Cambodian economy by creating employment opportunities for university graduates, creating opportunities for investment income, shifting habits from savings to "Investment, creating new investment options, diverting foreign investment to the country and increasing revenue for the state through taxes."
Mr. Long Samnang, Chief Financial Advisor and Mr. Ronald Wu, Financial Analyst at Golden FX Link Capital, gave a presentation to the participants on investing in derivatives, risk prevention and mitigation. Invest and good strategies to get the most out of your investment.
Please be informed that since 2018, Golden FX Link Capital Co., Ltd. has participated in provincial workshops in Preah Sihanouk, Kampong Cham, Siem Reap, Banteay Meanchey, Battambang, Takeo, Kampot, Kep, Kampong Chhnang, Pursat, Kandal, Prey Veng and Svay Rieng provinces. And Kampong Speu already, and the company will continue to travel and share investment knowledge to the public in all provinces of Cambodia.
