This is according to Mr. Phan Phalla, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance, speaking at a press conference on "National Progress and Equitable Distribution of Divisions" organized by the Spokesperson of the Royal Government on the morning of the 28th. This November 2019 in the Office of the Council of Ministers.
"For the peace we have had since 1998, this peace and political stability has allowed our people to have a chance to reap the benefits," said Phan Phalla. "Peace and political stability have brought the trust of foreign investors, brought economic growth, given people the opportunity to do business without fear and to be able to improve their livelihoods."
A senior official of the Ministry of Economy also claimed that through peace and political stability, it has attracted many foreign investors and created jobs for people at all levels, which is an opportunity to benefit from the benefits, including economic benefits. The rewards of peace and political stability.
