Minister of Water Resources and Administration of Kampong Speu Province Calls on People to Save Water for the Next Dry Season
(Kampong Speu): On November 28, 2019, Mr. Lim Kean Hor, Minister of Water Resources and Meteorology, accompanied by the Deputy Chief of Staff of Kampong Speu, Kandal and Phnom Penh, and other ministry leaders presided over the ceremony. Dissemination of Circular No. 11, dated November 21, 2019 of the Royal Government on taking measures to conserve water at Kampong Speu Provincial Hall.
