(Tbong Khmum): A farmer man living in Tbong Khmum province named Heng Chet, 30 years old, currently working as a headman, living in Machine village, Rong commune, Memot district, Tbong Khmum province.
Lucky to win a big prize from Carabao energy drink with 100 million Riel cash last weekend.
Mr. Heng Chet continued that last weekend, after leaving the field and sitting to rest a little tired, he used his children to buy a can of Carabao energy drink to eat, but when he picked it up. Suddenly, there was a prize of 100 million riels on the earring. Suddenly, he was very excited and called the nearby villagers to help, along with a phone call to inform the company.
He stated that this huge prize money is very important for his family's livelihood and after receiving it, he will take some to build debts and buy farmland to grow crops and save some to create a business to support. Family life in the future. Energy drinks are really worth the million dollars.
