The boundaries and areas of the Siem Pang Wildlife Sanctuary will be updated and revised through scientific research and data collection to ensure the value and benefits of biodiversity, economy and socio-culture. When not yet integrated, the Siem Pang Wildlife Sanctuary covers an area of 66,932 hectares, while the West Siem Pang Wildlife Sanctuary covers an area of 65,389 hectares.
