It should be noted that until now, the Royal Government has increased the area of protected areas under the jurisdiction of the Ministry of Environment, which covers an area of up to 41% of the country area, equivalent to about 7.2 million hectares, which makes Cambodia Ranked second in Asia after Bhutan.
