(Phnom Penh): Australia is a country that has provided many scholarships to Cambodian students and civil servants, both long-term and short-term scholarships, and the government has promised to provide more short-term scholarships to Cambodia. This was confirmed by Mr. Koy Kuong, spokesman for the Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation.
