Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) has decided to cut off electricity supply to Blue Bay construction site after committing a crime that destroyed electricity's property in Preah Sihanouk province.
(Preah Sihanouk): Electricite du Cambodge (EDC) has decided to cut off the electricity supply to the construction site of Blue Bay Company, located in Village 1, Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville, Preah Sihanouk Province, after the company committed a crime to destroy the property of Electricity of Preah Sihanouk Province. Sihanouk.
This decision was made on November 27, 2019, after the Sihanoukville Provincial Administrative Team inspected the construction site of Blue Bay Company after receiving a complaint from the Sihanoukville Electricity Authority.
After finding that there was a case of damage to the property of Electricity of Sihanoukville, Electricity of Sihanoukville filed a complaint to close the construction site of Blue Bay Company on plots 3548, 3549, 3517, 3518, 3157, 3155 and 3076, located in Village 1, Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville City, Sihanoukville Province, and will temporarily suspend the electricity supply until the settlement with the Sihanoukville Electricity Unit is completed, then the electricity connection will be re-used.
In this regard, Mr. Keo Rattanak, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister in charge of the Director General of Electricite du Cambodge (EDC), considered the actions of the Blue Bay construction site an anarchic act that did not consider the destruction of state property or electricity supply to the public. Regret for this intolerable act.
At the same time, Mr. Keo Rattanak, through Fresh News, would like to request the local authority to have the Department of Land Management, which is also the issuer of the construction law, please check carefully before issuing the permit to build so that the company Build and do whatever they want.
