The construction skills competition was held at the National Polytechnic Institute of Cambodia with the support of SCG, one of the leading corporations in ASEAN.
Speaking at the opening ceremony of the master craftsman competition, Mr. Lao Him, Undersecretary of State at the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training, said that the development of education, technical and vocational training requires the support and participation of the private sector.
"Let the company support all activities that the state needs to cooperate with the private sector, such as internships, research and development of training standards," he said.
