After receiving the official position, Mr. Ly Sophea, who has just become the Director of the Department of Social Affairs of Kampong Thom Province, is determined to do his job well and respect his role to best serve the interests of the local people.
Arrested a young man for forging a national police uniform in Por Sen Chey district
(Phnom Penh): The police force of the 3rd Chao Chao Post of Po Sen Chey District Inspectorate arrested a young man disguised as a national police uniform in order to attack innocent people, such as chasing motorbikes from local and district residents. Others in Phnom Penh.
Mr. Theng Kosal, Chief of the 3rd Chao Chao Police Station, said that the suspect, 24-year-old Touch David, was engaged in selling products online and lived in Toul Tompong II, Chamkar Mon District, and confiscated a Honda Dream 125 Series 014 motorcycle with a license plate. Phnom Penh number 1CU-9499 and a milk police uniform, a police hat. The victim was Chea Sophannath, 25, a factory worker living in a rented room in Ang village, Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Sen Chey.
All the bodies will be handed over to their families on Wednesday for a traditional funeral after arriving a few hours ago. The bodies of the remaining victims are expected to return to their home countries, but no date has been set for public release.
Cracking down on illegal car processing sites in Muk Kampoul district, Kandal province, confiscating 3 illegal recycling vehicles and the owners of the locations will be fined
(Kandal): Police in Kandal province, in cooperation with relevant officials, raided a location for cutting and installing non-technical vehicles in Prek Chrov village, Rokar Kong II commune, Muk Kampoul district, Kandal province on November 26, 2019.
Kandal Provincial Police told Fresh News that the operation took place between the Kandal Provincial Economic Crimes Police Office, the Kandal Provincial Customs and Excise Force, and the Muk Kampul District Police Inspectorate, the administrative police station and local authorities.
After arriving at the illegal recycling site, it was found that four vehicles were in the garage, but one was legal and the other three were illegal recycling vehicles. The owner of the venue did not appear to face the authorities, with a representative named Ung Sung Chhay, 25, representing him.
According to the procedure, the owner of this illegal car recycling facility will be fined by paying tax on the components of the car parts, while the value is multiplied by 3 times the import price. The owner of the same location will also be sued in court. And if you do not appear as summoned by the court, the court will have arrest measures in accordance with the procedure.
The above three vehicles were taken to the Customs and Excise Office of Kandal Province to follow the procedure. The above location is temporarily closed.
Another case was cracked down on July 1, 2019 in Damnak Koh village, Samrong Leu commune, Ang Snoul district, Kandal province. Cambodia, UN Jointly Launch Forum on Smart, Sustainable and Environmental Urban Development
