(Kampong Thom): Seeing the need for participation in environmental protection, especially Prey Lang, Mr. Nong Veasna, Member of Parliament for Kampong Thom Constituency and Chairman of Sandan District Assistance Team, contributed $ 10,000 per year. For 3 years to two protected area communities: Kbal Dauntei Protected Area Community and Choam Pepper Protected Community in Kampong Thom Province.
The support from the Kampong Thom MP is to improve the livelihood of the community by providing clean water management in the community, each community receives $ 5,000 per year for three consecutive years.
Mr. Nong Veasna considered that this support and this budget is to contribute to the conservation efforts of Prey Lang area of the nature protection community to preserve this special Prey Lang for the descendants of Cambodia for future generations. At the same time, Mr. Veasna also called on the authorities at all levels and all people to take care of our natural resources to survive.
