(Phnom Penh): The upcoming international half marathon on December 8 is getting closer. WURKZ Energy Drink, the main sponsor of this event, would like to encourage all young Cambodians who love sports to participate in the four-distance race in large numbers. The race will take place from 5:15 am in front of Angkor Wat.
