He said the 2H project started 20 years ago and has trained 4,000 midwives across the Kingdom of Cambodia. For Pailin province, just now for the first time to train midwives to have specific skills, especially to provide experience to each other through good communication, solidarity, high sense of responsibility with provincial doctors. .
Please note that the current training course lasts for 2 days from 25 to 26 November 2019 with the participation of a total of 30 midwives.
