2: Treaty on Legal Aid in the field of crime. Signed by Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Minister of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation, and Foreign Minister of the Republic of Korea Kang Kyung-wha.
3: Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) on cooperation in agriculture.
4: Memorandum of Understanding on Cooperation in the Field of Information and Communication Technology.
