Mr. Keo Remy made this thanks on the morning of November 25, 2019, when he presided over the opening ceremony of the lecture on "Together for Peacekeeping for the Promotion of Human Rights" organized by By the Cambodian Human Rights Committee and the Ratanakkiri Provincial Administration.
The Cambodian human rights chief said: "Those who are grateful to us to save the lives of parents, grandparents, and there is only us today, Samdech Techo Prime Minister and the leaders of the Cambodian People's Party."
