In an interview with Fresh News Agency, Christian Lee confirmed that he has traveled to entertainment venues, supermarkets and tourist destinations in Cambodia. Arriving in Siem Reap, one of Cambodia's main tourist destinations, the girl expressed excitement, briefly stating that Angkor Wat is one of Cambodia's great temples.
Angkor Wat is the largest Hindu temple and the largest religious monument in the world. This temple was built by King Suryavarman II, a great masterpiece and famous all over the world. This temple was built in the early 12th century, located in the capital of Yasodharapura (modern-day Angkor), the Khmer Empire, a temple representing Mount Sumeru.
Angkor Wat is a temple dedicated to Vishnu. This temple is the only temple that has left an important religious center since its foundation, first Brahmanism was worshiped to Vishnu, then Buddhism. This temple is in the top classical style of Khmer architecture.
Angkor Wat has become a symbol of Cambodia, featuring the Cambodian flag as a symbol of Cambodia and a temple for national and international tourists.
