(Phnom Penh): Representatives of 163 families led by Ms. Chea Sarom in Factory Village, Sangkat Kork Khleang, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh, who claimed to be the real owners of nearly 1 hectare of land and have lived since 1988 until winning the case from school First, the Supreme Court came forward to clarify the facts and reject 161 fake families created by a private company.
Ms. Chea Sarom said that for the 161 families who claimed to have sold their land to the company, it was only a matter of time before the other party set up to steal the land of her group, who had lived there since 1988 until a lawsuit was filed. Reached the court and won the case from the court of first instance to the Supreme Court in 2011.
Representatives of the 163 families claim that their land has been in dispute since 2005, almost 15 years ago. She told the story that on September 2, 2005, her land began to be disputed, with a company coming to clear the land in violation of the SPDC's regulations, after which they filed a complaint with the Phnom Penh Municipal Court. Phnom Penh.
It was not until May 2008 that the Phnom Penh Municipal Court ruled in their favor, but the company refused to appeal. In December 2008, the Court of Appeal ruled in their favor. He was sent to the Supreme Court, but was unsuccessful. During March 2011, the Supreme Court ruled that 163 families continued to win the case.
On June 08, 2012, the representatives of the Phnom Penh Municipal Prosecutor's Office enforced the judgment of the Supreme Court led by Deputy Prosecutor Top Chhun Long by handing over the land to 163 families who were legally occupied. Size 9992 square meters.
In total, all 163 families still consider Chea Sarom as their representative, and they claim that they still occupy the land every day according to the Supreme Court ruling and have not yet sold it to any party. If anyone comes out and claims to have sold to the company, they should reject it completely.
Details: Jealousy led to a man beheading his girlfriend and then jumping into the water to commit suicide in Svay Rieng province
(Svay Rieng): Due to jealousy, a man, a garment factory worker, decided to execute his girlfriend without remorse during a sweet time together for many years, and then jumped into the water to commit suicide after the end of his life. Also.
It should be noted that on the morning of November 22, 2019, at Roch Kathy White, a lamp manufacturer in Doeum Po village, Kandieng Reay commune, Svay Teap district, Svay Rieng province, there was a case of murder of a female factory worker. A vegetable-slicing knife was used to cut and stab a woman, injuring 14 people and killing her at the scene.
Local police told Fresh News that after a thorough investigation, the police identified the suspect as the victim's girlfriend.
According to the authorities, this murder case was caused by the suspect named Neang Krem, 25 years old, living in Romduol district, who was the girlfriend of the victim named Khem Pisal, 24 years old, living in Sangke village, Chheu Teal commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province. Authorities said that the reason why the suspect killed the victim was his girlfriend because the woman's family refused to marry.
According to the same source, while secretly falling in love with her boyfriend, the victim also had a husband and a small child. That's it. Later, some information confirmed that the victim was likely having an affair with another man in the factory, then suddenly the assailant, who had been in love for 3-4 years, was upset and jealous until there were frequent disputes with each other. .
On the morning of the incident, on the morning of November 22, 2019, the fire of jealousy intensified, making the perpetrator unable to think long enough to kill the victim.
Immediately after receiving the information, Brigadier General Koy Sopheap, Deputy Provincial Police Commissioner for Criminal Affairs, Director of the Bureau of Serious Crimes, Technical and Scientific Police Office and Inspector-Deputy Inspector of Svay Teap District, together with the medical team, surrounded and examined the body to identify the target. Hands up.
But the suspect after the action escaped from the scene and disappeared. After the body was examined, with the approval of the Brigadier General, the Deputy Commissioner for Criminal Planning, the body was handed over to Mr. Khem Hun, the father of the body, for a traditional ceremony.
Suddenly, at 11:30 on November 23, 2019, the killer who strangled and killed a factory worker was confirmed by Svay Rieng provincial police to jump into the water and kill himself.
The body of the killer was found by residents and authorities at a lake east of the TY factory in Doeum Po village, Kandeang Reay commune, Svay Teap district.
Svay Rieng provincial police said that the man who killed the woman yesterday jumped into the water and was found this morning and handed over the body to the family for a traditional ceremony.
