Please be informed that Princess Ream Norodom Bopha Devi, the eldest son of His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk, King of Cambodia, died at 12:30 noon on November 18, 2019 in the hospital. Kingdom of Thailand by old age.
Princess Ream Norodom Bopha Devi is the eldest daughter of His Majesty King Norodom Sihanouk, the King Father and Miss Phat Kanoul, the dancer of the Royal Ballet. He was ready to create the second mother of His Majesty the Prince of Life on the Stone, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom of Cambodia.
Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon, Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Attends Two Important Meetings in South Korea
According to the program, Deputy Prime Minister Prak Sokhon will attend the ASEAN-Republic of Korea Memorial Summit and the Mekong-Republic of Korea Summit from November 25 to 27.
In addition to these two important meetings, the Deputy Prime Minister will lead a delegation to a bilateral meeting with the Foreign Minister of the Republic of Korea, during which the two heads of diplomacy will sign a number of agreements. The Deputy Prime Minister will also meet with the mayor of Busan.
The ASEAN-ROK Summit will mark the 30th anniversary of the ASEAN-ROK Dialogue Partnership and will define future cooperation to strengthen the strategic partnership between ASEAN and the Republic of Korea. New, higher.
In addition, the two summits will become more important events to further promote the partnership between Cambodia, the Republic of Korea, ASEAN, the Republic of Korea and the Mekong-Republic of Korea for the real benefit and prosperity of the people. People.
