The 6th National Film Festival 2019 will be held for 5 days from 25-29 November 2019 at the upcoming conference hall. The 6th National Film Festival is organized under the theme "Together to promote Khmer cinema".
The 6th National Film Festival 2019 is not only a forum for film competitions to win awards, but also a forum for gathering, studying, understanding, measuring and sharing experiences and knowledge in the field of film to enhance capacity and improve quality. Film works to compete in both domestic and foreign film markets.
All films submitted to the competition must focus on one of the following topics:
1: Educate and disseminate knowledge about culture, traditions and national traditions. 2. Promote a culture of peace, strengthen national unity and solidarity. 3. Create creativity or reflect social reality.
All films submitted to the 6th National Film Festival 2019 must comply with the following conditions: 1. Cambodian films produced by local production and licensed by the Ministry of Culture and Fine Arts. : A Cambodian film that was produced between 2016 and 2019 and has never competed in the National Film Festival.
(Phnom Penh): People in our world long for peace, because everyone knows that peace is like medicine and is the most difficult thing to accept if neglected. Therefore, before there can be peace, there must be no war.
According to Chuon Nath's dictionary, peace is a journey of peace, tranquility, and healing. So what does each person need to participate in to achieve this peaceful and healing journey?
True, the beginning of the birth of world peace is born of three small peace factors: family, community and nation, including:
* First: Family peace: is a family full of happiness, living together, spouses, children, not adultery, quarreling, arguing, value, role, respect and care for each other.
* Second: Community peace: Many families together form a community. So when the family is peaceful, of course, the community is also peaceful, with the families in the community doing good to each other, protecting each other, helping each other and participating in community development voluntarily.
* Third: National peace: Many communities together form a nation. Therefore, when many communities are not divided, disagree and respect the national law, the nation will be at peace.
In conclusion, the peace of the above three factors is the root to world peace to be full of strength and longevity, and really the deepest logic, which is consistent with the strong words of Samdech Techo "to keep the peace. At any cost.
