The main purpose of this project is to create a path for progressive development in villages that are considered mine-free with national and international partners to address community development challenges and reduce poverty among vulnerable families. Most.
The project is located along the border between Cambodia and Thailand in three contiguous provinces: Battambang, Pailin and Banteay Meanchey.
