One local agricultural company presents its features that respond to the current agricultural situation
(Phnom Penh): Observing that the demand for fertilizers, pesticides and agricultural equipment is still limited for the agricultural sector, a Japanese agricultural company that has been in business for more than 5 years, called Hayashi Yepeng Agricultural Co. (HJA), has shown its special features. Its response to the current agricultural situation.
The features of Hayasidepay Agricultural Co., Ltd., which has the resources to respond to the current agricultural situation in Cambodia, are:
* First: Japanese Agricultural Specialist: Dr. Nabeshima Katsuhito is the CEO of the company and is also an agricultural specialist who often works directly with agricultural producers to provide technical advice on cultivation from the beginning of cultivation. Until harvest. In particular, disease prevention factors and how to solve the problem of cultivation, so far he has implemented agricultural techniques in almost all provinces and cities and crops.
* Second: Laboratory analysis of agricultural land: HJA is the first agricultural company in Cambodia that specializes in modern and specific agricultural techniques. This includes agricultural soil analysis services that provide benefits to know the quality and requirements of soil nutrients and essential nutrients for soil cultivation.
In particular, the next service after HJA soil analysis also has agricultural doctors to prepare fertilizer formulas or modify unnecessary substances and replenish the required amount of nutrients, which helps reduce production costs without incurring costs. Wasteful and does not affect the health of the soil, producers and consumers.
* Third: Organic and safe fertilizers of all kinds: Today, the company has imported organic and safe fertilizers directly from Japan and is properly registered to supply the local market demand, which can be used on all types of crops.
