The Asia-Pacific Summit is aimed at strengthening the government-civil society partnership, which is central to peace and development, climate change and conflict resolution, and critical solutions.
53 kg of defective goods were found for sale in the houses of Battambang residents, provincial CamControl officers confiscated and burned
