(Phnom Penh): The Royal Government of Cambodia Spokesperson Unit led by Mr. Phay Siphan will hold a press conference on "Cambodia-China Free Trade Agreement" at 9:30 on November 21, 2019. This is at the Council of Ministers, Hall B, ground floor.
