Samdech Techo Hun Sen's remarks were made on the evening of November 18, 2019, when he allowed a delegation of about 400 coaches and athletes to pay a courtesy call and receive some recommendations from Prince at the Peace Palace before Cambodian athletes leave for the 30th SEA Games in the Philippines from November 30 to December 11, 2019.
