(Kampong Thom): The professional staff of the National Bank of Cambodia continued to disseminate and explain to stakeholders, especially the people and the public in Stong district, Kampong Thom province, about the use of loans to get rid of debtors. Citizens cheat corrupt people, especially illegal moneylenders.
