Dr. Kim Heang said that for KW-Cambodia is a company with strong skills, sales skills. For Kampong Samnang housing project, it is a project that passes legally, has a good geographical location, has the right land title documents, the reputation of the project owner and is also experienced in construction. Therefore, the joint venture to sell this project will sell better.
