According to Mr. Srey Thamrong, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister, during the meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Mr. Tou Chea Hov had a cordial discussion on many issues related to trade relations between Cambodia and Cambodia. China speaks as a whole, as well as between Cambodia and Hunan in particular.
