Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presides Over the Graduation Ceremony of Nearly 2,000 Students of the University of Human Resources (Phnom Penh): This morning, Monday, November 18, 2019 The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen presides over the graduation ceremony for a total of 1,958 students of the University of Human Resources after their successful graduation. The graduation ceremony took place at the National Institute of Education.
The following are the words of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that allowing the private sector to provide education is a targeted and problem-solving solution.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that allowing state higher education institutions to provide free education can help them to survive and develop better.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that allowing the private sector to participate in education and for higher education institutions to provide free education is a success of the Royal Government's education policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is developing without development, training is useless. That is, graduates will be unemployed.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Vietnam in the past did not prosper, graduates are unemployed. After the political and economic changes, Vietnam prospered with its existing human resources.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that professional skills in Cambodia are not very popular and do not want to do, while professional skills are important for society.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government of Cambodia has made great efforts to find markets abroad, but has been criticized by the opposition.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during his upcoming trip to South Korea, Samdech will raise the issue of sending workers to work in this country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that if you do not want people to work abroad easily, end the agreement to send workers with the country to send workers, it is already, but do not want to do this is very harmful to workers
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on his way to South Korea, Samdech will meet with the President of South Korea, so if workers in Korea are not happy to work in Korea, just Samdech terminates the agreement to send workers. Samdech Techo said that this is just an analysis for workers, but the Royal Government does not do that because people will lose income.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has just sent more than 50,000 people to work in South Korea, while Vietnam and Thailand have sent tens of thousands of people to work in Korea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government is trying to find jobs abroad for the people. For example, requesting South Korea and Japan to increase the quota for Cambodian workers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that each year, the University of Human Resources provides more than 100 million Riels to help poor students.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that society does not stand still, it is developing very fast. In this sense, Samdech Techo urges graduates to make efforts to further develop their abilities.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ordered prisoner Sam Rainsy to accuse Samdech of stealing his plane ticket. Samdech Techo said that the world must be careful about Samdech's ability, because Samdech can go to change the plane ticket.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that the problem is at the international level and the prisoner Sam Rainsy dared to explain and deceive the people. What about this normal job in the country, how does this person cheat?
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the role of commune members of the former CNRP will never be restored after their party was dissolved in 2017.
* Samdech Techo stated that the new Commune / Sangkat Council Election will be held in May 2022, while the National Assembly Election will be held in July 2023.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on November 9, 223 tons of ambok were eaten. This only counts for the purpose of gathering, organizing, eating ambok, not including eating at home yet.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the past ambok eating event showed the common spirit of the people in maintaining peace, defending the nation, religion and the King.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that at all costs, we must work together to maintain this peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech was really happy to see the good condition of the celebration of the Royal Water Festival, floating lanterns and worshiping the moon in the past.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the salaries of civil servants in the Armed Forces will increase in January and April 2020.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that along with the increase in the salaries of civil servants in the Armed Forces and the wages of workers, it is necessary to try to keep the price of goods on the market from rising so that the civil servants in the Armed Forces Workers get a better life from this increase in salaries and wages.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia's first drop of oil will be received in 2020, but did not specify a date yet.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is exploring for coal in Oddar Meanchey province and will establish a power plant.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in addition to oil and coal mining, Cambodia will also have investment in gold mining by Australian companies, which earns a decent income.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has announced that revenue from natural resources will be spent on both hard and soft infrastructure, including roads, canals and education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although the income is high, but not just spending, but to save money to spend on necessities.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this year the Royal Government has invested about $ 1 billion in infrastructure investment in Sihanoukville and the purchase of a 400-megawatt generator and spending on other projects.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that before there was no land needed, but now people are vying for land, which is due to the peace and development of society.
