Kampong Svay Iron Sword has a great history for the Khmer nation, prompting the authorities to build a huge statue
In order to commemorate the power and show the people who work in Kampong Thom, the provincial authorities have decided to build a large iron sword statue of Kampong Svay at the point of the pig nose Kampong Thom - Siem Reap and Kampong Thom - Preah Vihear in Thnal Bek village, Trapeang Russey commune, Kampong Svay district.
On the 17th of November, the Krong Pali Ceremony and Groundbreaking Ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Chhun Chhon, Chairman of the Provincial Council and Mr. Sok Lou, Governor of Kampong Thom Province, and Mrs. and Mrs. Chatva and the chief of Kampong Thom province, as well as government officials, the army, students and a large number of citizens.
Mr. Sok Lou said that the team and experts discussed and decided to build a sword statue without a sheath and wanted to show the appearance of the mighty Kampong Svay steel sword.
He prepared the history of the Iron Sword of Kampong Svay and the history of Kampong Thom province: from between the 10th century AD, Kampong Thom province was named Asanduk district (the word district in ancient times means the province as it is today). This district of Asantuk continued to be used until the 17th century, that is, until the middle period of Khmer history.
During the reign of King Chantrea, he ordered the appointment of Oknha Chao Ponhea Utay Reachea as the governor of Asantuk district and also the army chief. At that time, the first town, district or province was located in Preah Indrakoma village and later back to Kampong Svay village (along Stung Sen river).
As for the history of Kampong Svay Iron Sword, Mr. Sok Lou told that in the territory of Kampong Svay district from ancient times, there are people living both Khmer and Kuy people. The Kui people are an excellent breed of blacksmiths for ancient use or for the production of all kinds of tools or high-quality weapons.
It should be noted that the iron sword statue of Kampong Svay under construction is 6.4 meters long, 0.45 meters wide, 0.70 meters thick at the base, 0.30 meters at the base of the sword, 0.20 meters at the end of the sword, and 0.10 meters at the front of the sword. M. Retail fuel prices at stations from today to November 30: regular gasoline at 3,700 riel and diesel at 3,450 riel per liter
