Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh reaffirmed his willingness to work together with all ASEAN members in the current security framework. In the spirit of ASEAN, we will work together to maintain unity and solidarity in dialogue and working with partners outside the region to ensure peace, stability, security, development and prosperity in the region.
