Ministry of Justice Spokesperson: Whether or not to drop the court's charges depends on the results of the investigation of the facts and evidence! (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Mr. Kim Santepheap, Secretary of State and Spokesman of the Ministry of Justice, on November 14, 2019, stated that whether or not to drop the court's charges depends on the results of the investigation. On facts and evidence.
