Two concrete roads with a length of nearly 3 km in Teuk Vil commune, Kandal province were opened for construction
(Kandal): A group of villagers expressed their happiness because the road in the village used to be dirty and now the Kandal Provincial Administration has opened the construction site for them as a concrete road.
There are two concrete roads with a total length of 2,600 meters, located in Tuol Khmounh village, 1,600 meters long and 5 meters wide, and Prek Thmey village, 1,000 meters long and 4 meters wide, in Teuk Vil commune, Saang district, Kandal province.
