He said that seeing the difficulty in traveling and with the request of the people, the Kandal Provincial Administration has built a concrete road to build this concrete road to reduce difficulties and make it easier. Travel as well as farmers can easily transport agricultural products to sell in the market. The opening of the concrete road construction site is a provincial benefit budget for 2019.
