The Senate will hold a meeting of the Standing Committee with 6 agendas.
According to the announcement of the General Secretariat of the Senate, the six agendas are as follows:
1. Examine and decide on the request of the Fourth Committee of the Senate to submit the draft law on the ratification of the Supplementary Treaty on the 1985 State Boundary Treaty and the 2005 Supplementary Treaty between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Socialist Republic of Vietnam. Agenda of the 4th session of the Senate of the 4th legislature.
2. Review and decide on the request of the Second Committee of the Senate to submit the draft law on the approval of the agreement between the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region of the People's Republic of China on tax evasion. And the prevention of tax evasion related to income tax into the agenda of the 4th session of the 4th Senate.
3. Examine and decide on the request of the Second Committee of the Senate to submit the draft law on the approval of the second protocol on the demarcation of the border framework of the ASEAN Framework Agreement on the Facilitation of Transit of Goods in Agenda of the 4th session of the Senate of the 4th legislature.
4. Examine and decide on the request of the Ninth Committee of the Senate to put the draft law on the approval of the ASEAN Agreement on e-commerce into the agenda of the 4th session of the 4th Senate.
5: Examine and decide on the request of the Third Committee of the Senate to submit the draft law on the approval of the Kingdom of Cambodia to be a member of the framework agreement on the establishment of the International Solar Alliance into the agenda of the next session. Fourth, the Senate of the fourth legislature.
6. Set the agenda and date for the resumption of the 4th session of the 4th Senate.
