Cellcard, a proud Cambodian company, is honored to support a group of boat racers as they prepare to bring pride to their village / commune in this world-famous race. This is the third year in a row that Cellcard has supported the organization of the entire Water Festival by supporting several boat races.
A special program to celebrate the Water Festival as well as to wish all the boat racers success will be held at Cellcard Head Office from 1pm to 3pm today with a welcome speech and special entertainment program for 300 boat racers will gather there.
Cellcard CEO Ian Watson said: "The whole Cellcard family is excited about the upcoming celebration and we look forward to seeing what the team will achieve. Competition day.
Mr. Ian Watson added, “The Water Festival is a great time for Cellcard to donate to the community we have served for the past 22 years. This program makes Cambodia and Cellcard proud every year. The Water Festival is deeply rooted in the Khmer tradition and celebrates the confluence of the four rivers in Phnom Penh. ”
Cellcard rowers have a good track record. Last year, out of 17 Cellcard-backed 17 teams, the first and second place winners of the competition won.
This year, we expect a large number of visitors, as well as local and international media coverage. We are confident that our team will do well and we wish them the strength to get on the boat faster. ”
