First, Samdech Techo Hun Sen is a very influential leader in both domestic politics and diplomacy. In the country, Samdech Techo can tightly control the whole national force, the mass force, the civil servants and the armed forces of all kinds. In fact, the organization of the ombok dinner on November 9 is expected to be attended by large crowds everywhere.
