(Phnom Penh): The Governor of Phnom Penh, Mr. Khuong Sreng, urged the working group and relevant officials under the administration of Phnom Penh to complete their remaining work today due to the National Independence Day and the Royal Water Festival. Floating lanterns to worship the moon god and Ok Ambok 2019 is approaching. Phnom Penh must be more beautiful than last year to welcome national and international tourists from all over.
