(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration on November 6 presented some roads to avoid traffic during the National Independence Day celebration which will take place on November 9 to make this National Day run smoothly. Maintain security, safety, order and public order, especially reduce traffic congestion.
The Phnom Penh Capital Administration will avoid traffic from the banks of the Tonle Sap River along Street 178, Norodom Blvd., Street 214, Street 51, Street 294, Samdech Sothearos Neak Blvd. From 6:00 am until the end of the festival.
