Lt. Gen. Chan Sopheaktra stated that the Cambodian Veterans Association, headed by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, was established to encourage the well-being of our veterans after dedicating their time and energy to joining the Royal Government. In working for the motherland until peace and development progress to this day.
In fact, today, the Cambodian Veterans Association of Preah Vihear Province led the working group of the Cambodian Veterans Association of Sangkum Thmei District and local authorities to rent a house as a precious gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, 4x6 meters, built of wood. Zinc roof with a cost of 8850,000 Riels to the family of a disabled veteran named Chum Pum, male, 55 years old, living in the above commune village.
