As Vietnam came to buy Khmer pigs and there was no export law, they stopped and interrogated and pumped the pig's blood to the Department of Animal Production in Phnom Penh to enter the laboratory to check if there is no virus, the department will hand it over to the owner to sell and distribute in Svay Rieng province. It is not allowed to export to Vietnam and if it is infected, we will destroy it.
