He said that Phnom Penh noodles are famous all over Cambodia and many countries, but national-international tourists or noodle eaters whenever they go to a restaurant to eat Phnom Penh noodles is difficult because there is nothing to Confirm that it is a brand of Phnom Penh Noodles. Usually when international guests come to Cambodia, they always want to taste this Phnom Penh noodles, but they can not buy right because there is no sign.
He continued, "His Excellency Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, has initiated the construction of the Phnom Penh Noodle Collective Brand with the support of the World Intellectual Property Organization and the cooperation of the Cambodian Chefs' Community Association with national and international expertise. And this project has been implemented since the beginning of 2018, by building a legal document related to the construction of the Phnom Penh Noodle Collective Brand.
He said that the Department of Intellectual Property has always worked with the Cambodian Chefs Association to gather all the information and document and make Phnom Penh Noodles have a clear brand to make it easier for customers when they want to eat. Phnom Penh noodles can be obtained and can mark the mark.
"The collective brand is simple, has a wide range of purposes and is widely used," he said. The main goal of creating this collective mass is to promote the noodle sector to improve, create a business model and make it easier for noodle sellers to profit from the Phnom Penh Noodle Collective brand, as you can see. "Even the name uses a collective brand."
