Today's plenary session of the National Assembly was chaired by Samdech Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, with the participation of 110 members of the National Assembly.
The five draft laws approved by the National Assembly include:
1. Draft Law on the Approval of the Supplementary Treaty on the 1985 State Boundary Treaty and the 2005 Supplementary Treaty between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Socialist Republic of Vietnam.
2. Draft Law on the Approval of the Agreement between the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region of the People's Republic of China on the Avoidance of Double Taxation and the Prevention of Tax Fraud Related to Taxes Revenue.
3. Draft Law on the Approval of the Second Protocol on the Demarcation of the Transit Border Gate of the ASEAN Framework Agreement on the Coordination of Transit of Goods
4. Draft Law on the Approval of the ASEAN Agreement on E-Commerce
5. Draft Law on the Approval of the Kingdom of Cambodia as a Member of the Framework Agreement on the Establishment of the International Solar Energy Alliance.
