The passage of the draft law was supported by the 110 members of parliament present at the plenary session. The meeting was chaired by Samdech Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly of Cambodia.
The 2019 Supplementary Treaty was drafted bilaterally through five rotating meetings, four exchange of diplomatic documents and a letter of correspondence confirming each side's position. Agree 3 times. In addition to the joint drafting, the two sides also studied and experimented with the border treaty that Vietnam made with China and Laos.
The 2019 Supplementary Treaty shall be ratified and entered into force after the change of instrument of ratification and in three languages: Khmer, Vietnamese and French. In case of different interpretations, the text in French shall be used as the base document.
The 2019 Supplementary Treaty is the most important historical document in the history of the two countries' achievements so far, which is 84%, and also the foundation document to protect the territorial integrity of Cambodia with no borders. Change and maintain the border of peace, stability, friendship, cooperation and development in all fields for the peace of the people of Cambodia forever.
In early October 2019, Cambodia and Vietnam signed two agreements, including (1) the Supplementary Treaty on the 1985 State Boundary Treaty and the 2005 Supplementary Treaty between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Socialist Republic of Vietnam; and (2) : Protocol for the demarcation of the border and the establishment of the land border between the Kingdom of Cambodia and the Socialist Republic of Vietnam.
