Lim Seng Heang also sent nude photos of the victim to her relatives and friends, including photos of the two of them sleeping together, and Lim Seng Heang continued to share the nude photos of the victim. Chat period in many other groups.
According to the confession of the perpetrator, he really loved living with the victim and took many nude photos of the victim because the victim tried to separate, so he decided to send nude photos of the victim. Victims to relatives and friends in other groups look to damage the reputation in order for the victim to live with them.
