(Siem Reap): Two illegal structures built in violation of Tuol Kork Kou and on the back of the Trapeang He Phka Dam, built in the 9th century in the village of Bos Kralanh, Sangkat Chreav, Siem Reap City, have been completely demolished by the authorities.
