More than 500 national and international athletes participate in Kampong Thom 2019 Half Marathon at Sambor Prei Kuk Temple Resort
(Kampong Thom): The Kampong Thom Half Marathon Organizing Committee, in collaboration with the Ministry of Tourism, the National Olympic Committee of Cambodia, the Sambo Prei Kuk National Authority and other relevant institutions in Kampong Thom province, organized the Kampong Thom Half Marathon Tournament at the Sambo Prei Kuk Resort on November 3, 2019, attracting the participation of more than 500 national and international runners.
