(Phnom Penh): In the morning of October 31, 2019, the Ministry of Economy and Finance organized a consultative workshop on the draft Prakas on "Real Estate Development Business Management" with relevant institutions, housing development companies and subdivision businesses under the chairmanship. Of Mrs. Nguon Sokha, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Economy and Finance.
Ms. Nguon Sokha stated that this is the third time that the Ministry of Economy and Finance has revised this draft declaration to be in line with the evolution of economic growth and the real estate market in Cambodia. Such amendments to regulations are not limited to Cambodia, but also to other countries to ensure economic, political and social sustainability.
The meeting focused on monitoring the progress of the implementation of the third phase of the Public Financial Management Reform Program for the third quarter of 2019. The meeting was held at the Ministry of Economy and Finance on October 30, 2019.
According to the summary report, in the third quarter of 2019, all aspects of the joint action plan of public financial management reform continue to make good and positive progress. In general, revenue collection and expenditure performance remained healthy compared to previous years and maintained good trends as planned.
(Kampong Cham): Fearing danger to the people, on October 31, 2019, the Governor of Kampong Cham Province, Mr. Un Chanda, ordered the authorities to temporarily stop traffic across the Kien Chrey Bridge. This action was taken after water leaked from the foundation of the bridge and the bank collapsed along the canal in Kien Chrey village, Kien Chrey commune, Kampong Siem district, Kampong Cham province.
The provincial governor confirmed that the stone bridge, which is facing collapse, in the near future, officials from the Ministry of Rural Development will visit to study the possibility to rebuild the new bridge and build a bypass to facilitate traffic. People, too.
At the same time, the provincial governor called on the people to be patient and follow the instructions of the competent authorities to avoid crossing the stone bridge at risk, which could lead to any accident eventually. Unexpected.
US Secretary of State John Kerry has said he will "put more pressure on China" because of China's aggressive policies.
NEW YORK (Reuters) - US Secretary of State Mike Pompeo has vowed to step up pressure on China over a number of issues, accusing Beijing of pursuing "anti-US" policies. This is according to the release by CNA on the afternoon of Thursday, October 31, 2019.
According to Mike Pompeo, he will deliver more speeches in the coming days on anti-Beijing issues in areas ranging from ideology to trade and increasing Chinese influence in the United States. The United States and so on.
(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner, Major General Chuon Narin, told Fresh News at 12 noon on October 31, 2019 that the case of fire in people's stalls near the market. Leu in Sangkat 1, Sihanoukville has disappeared after being rescued by law enforcement forces.
The General Commissioner confirmed that in this social accident, about 14 stalls of people were destroyed, while the authorities used several water trucks to intervene and rescue them completely at around 11 am. Separately, for the reason, the specialized police force is doing research.
It should be informed that in this incident, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province also intervened and inspected at the scene.
However, the fire did not cause any casualties, only the destruction of some materials and property. Authorities banned the sale of roads on the river in Kratie.
(Kratie): Kratie Provincial Authority led by Mr. Chak Meng Heang, Deputy Governor, at midnight on October 31, 2019, organized order and banned traders on the riverside road at the upper port. Kratie Sangkat to reduce traffic congestion and make the city more beautiful.
According to the announcement of Kratie Municipality on October 9, 2019, all traders who have a shop at the upper port (riverside) are invited to a meeting to draw lots. On October 14th.
The municipal administration has already organized the lottery according to the number of stalls for the traders, but some people did not come to the lottery, so the Kratie city administration requires the traders who have already received their stall numbers and some traders. Have not yet drawn the number of the municipal administration booth, please do the following:
* First: For traders who have already drawn the lottery must go to sell at their location from October 30, 2019 onwards, if any trader refuses to sell at their location, it means that you give up. Eligibility for stalls
* Second: For the 37 people named in the list who did not participate in the lottery for the booth number on October 14, must contact the Kratie Municipality every working hour to get the booth number from the date of notification. By October 30, if you do not contact the municipal administration, it means that you have waived the right to accept the stall.
* Third: For the traders who have already been selected from October 30 to November 15, 2019, if you do not agree to sell at your new location, the Port Order Organizing Committee will disqualify you. Stall management.
On the morning of October 31, Mr. Chak Mengheang confirmed that the authorities had informed him several times by arranging a place for them to sell, but some of them were still selling on the street, and he would do his best. For all members of the Provincial and Municipal Public Order Organizing Committee.
